## Split personality

split-personality-alter-awakened = Something stirs in your head. You are no longer alone in this body.
split-personality-swap-no-alter = Your other persona has not woken up yet.
split-personality-swap-suppressed = The medicine dulls your other persona, you cannot reach it right now.
split-personality-swap-pending = You are already waiting for your other persona to answer.
split-personality-swap-unavailable = Your other persona does not answer.
split-personality-swap-requested = You reach out to your other persona and wait for an answer...
split-personality-swap-denied = Your other persona did not want to switch places.
split-personality-swap-surfaced = You surface and feel the body again.
split-personality-swap-receded = You sink deep into your mind and watch the world from the side.
split-personality-faded = Your other persona grows quiet and fades away.
split-personality-cured = Your thoughts clear up: it is only you in your head again.

split-personality-request-title = Switch personas
split-personality-request-text = Your other persona asks to switch places. If you agree, the persona that is currently inside takes control of the body and the other one watches from within. Talk to each other through [bold]+з[/bold].
split-personality-request-accept = Switch
split-personality-request-deny = Refuse

collective-mind-split-personality-inner-voice = Inner voice

ghost-role-information-split-personality-name = Other persona
ghost-role-information-split-personality-description = A crew member has a split personality and you are their other persona. You have your own name, character and views, but you share the body. You can only switch places by mutual agreement.
ghost-role-information-split-personality-rules = You are not an antagonist. You share the body with another player: respect them, talk through the inner voice and do not use the body against them or the crew. Haloperidol suppresses you, and neuroleptin can cure the split completely.

## Imaginary friend

imaginary-friend-appeared = You feel like someone is right next to you.
imaginary-friend-cured = You no longer feel the presence of the one who was always with you.

ghost-role-information-imaginary-friend-name = Imaginary friend
ghost-role-information-imaginary-friend-description = You are the imaginary friend of a crew member. Only they can see and hear you, everyone else does not exist for you, and you do not exist for them.
ghost-role-information-imaginary-friend-rules = You are not an antagonist. You cannot touch anything and always stay near your friend. Haloperidol makes you vanish while it is in their blood, and neuroleptin can get rid of you for good.

## Medicine

reagent-name-neuroleptin = neuroleptin
reagent-desc-neuroleptin = A strong antipsychotic. Kept in the blood for about a minute, it cures split personalities and imaginary friends. Causes drowsiness and is toxic in overdose.

## Event and admin actions

station-event-psychic-anomaly-announcement = Attention crew: station sensors have detected a surge of psychic activity, and some crew members may experience perception disorders and split personalities. The medical department is advised to examine personnel and prescribe haloperidol or neuroleptin if symptoms are found.

psychosis-admin-verb-split = Give a split personality
psychosis-admin-verb-friend = Give an imaginary friend
psychosis-admin-verb-cure = Cure psychosis
